<!--
  EciModeExtensions was public through 1.1.1 with every one of its members internal, so
  no caller could ever call anything on it: a static class exposes nothing but its name.
  Making it internal in 1.2.0 is a removal on paper and nothing in practice, which is why
  it is suppressed here rather than deprecated until 2.0.0. Compression got the other
  treatment - [Obsolete] until 2.0.0 - because its members were usable.

  Keep this file to entries that are provably unusable from outside the assembly. A real
  breaking change belongs in a major version, not here.
-->
